{"ticker":"HUDCO","symbol":"HUDCO","instrumentId":3150630,"name":"Housing & Urban Dev.","industry":"NSE-Finance-Consumer Loans","about":"Housing & Urban Development Corporation Ltd. (HUDCO) is a government-owned entity that plays a key role in financing housing and urban development projects across India. HUDCO supports affordable housing for economically weaker sections, slum redevelopment, and urban infrastructure projects like water supply, sanitation, and public transport. With its focus on inclusive growth, HUDCO provides long-term finance to state governments, municipalities, and private sector developers. It helps address India's growing urbanization needs by promoting sustainable urban planning and infrastructure development. HUDCO has a significant impact on the nation's housing sector, ensuring access to homes for all segments of society.","website":"www.hudco.org.in","location":"India","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:24:53.599Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":165.68,"changePct":2.499381341252178,"week52High":239.57,"week52Low":143.07},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹33,167 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹14,752 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"500,475,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"154"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"238,535,424"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"3.23%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.62"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.13"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.41"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"22%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"7.44"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"4–28"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"19.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-169.4"},{"label":"Volume","value":"3,251,628"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"2,861,853"},{"label":"Master score","value":"49"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"85"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"27"},{"label":"Group rank","value